      "recipe": "packages/ffmpeg",
      "stage": 3,
      "version": "9.0.1",
      "nevra": null,
      "note": "The same rename as `ffmpeg`, one layer down: Fedora's suffixed build provides libavcodec.so.62 from libavcodec-free. Bluefin names `libavcodec` on the install line so negativo17's build wins over Fedora's; in a transaction of factory plus Hummingbird alone there is no second candidate to beat."
    },
