      "note": "A comps group is not a package. Groups are defined by repository metadata, and a repository assembled with `createrepo_c` and no comps file has none, so `@multimedia` cannot resolve against the factory however many of its members are built. Its members are expanded into requirements of their own above, which is the measurable half; publishing a comps file alongside the repository is a publication-format change and belongs to a human."
